{"seq":3,"slug":"split-rule-priority-config","title":"拆单规则与优先级配置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-intelligent-split-fulfillment/split-factor-rule/split-rule-priority-config","wordCount":2102,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"拆单规则与优先级配置\">拆单规则与优先级配置</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-因子是事实-规则是判断-优先级是秩序\">核心概念：因子是事实，规则是判断，优先级是秩序</h2><p>前两篇给出了拆单要用到的全部事实：每个仓的净 ATP、商品的特货属性、包裹的体积重与分区费率、清关主体。这一篇处理的是「谁来判断」——把事实变成拆单动作的那一层。它必须是<strong>可配置的</strong>，因为业务规则的变化频率远高于代码：某个国家突然对某类商品加了监管条件、某个渠道临时禁运电池、某段时间为了控成本强制要求「能用单仓就不用多仓」。把这些写进代码意味着每次业务调整都要发版，写进配置则可以在分钟级生效。</p>\n<p>规则系统有三个层次，混在一起会导致不可维护：<strong>条件</strong>（condition，判断事实是否满足某谓词）、<strong>动作</strong>（action，满足时执行什么，如拆单、换仓、标记）、<strong>优先级</strong>（priority，多条规则同时命中时谁说话）。这三者里最容易设计错的是优先级——很多系统把它做成了「先定义先赢」或「数值小的先赢」，然后在规则数量增长后陷入无法预测的行为。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[事实集合&lt;br/&gt;ATP / 特货 / 体积重 / 清关主体] --&gt; B[匹配引擎]&#10;  B --&gt; C{哪些规则命中?}&#10;  C --&gt;|0 条| D[无规则干预&lt;br/&gt;交给优化器自由寻优]&#10;  C --&gt;|1 条| E[直接执行该规则动作]&#10;  C --&gt;|多条| F[冲突消解]&#10;  F --&gt; G[不冲突: 全部生效]&#10;  F --&gt; H[冲突: 按优先级生效]&#10;  G --&gt; I[约束集合]&#10;  H --&gt; I&#10;  I --&gt; J[交给优化器&lt;br/&gt;见 第二章]\">graph TD\n  A[事实集合&lt;br/&gt;ATP / 特货 / 体积重 / 清关主体] --&gt; B[匹配引擎]\n  B --&gt; C{哪些规则命中?}\n  C --&gt;|0 条| D[无规则干预&lt;br/&gt;交给优化器自由寻优]\n  C --&gt;|1 条| E[直接执行该规则动作]\n  C --&gt;|多条| F[冲突消解]\n  F --&gt; G[不冲突: 全部生效]\n  F --&gt; H[冲突: 按优先级生效]\n  G --&gt; I[约束集合]\n  H --&gt; I\n  I --&gt; J[交给优化器&lt;br/&gt;见 第二章]</pre><h2 id=\"条件表达式与匹配引擎\">条件表达式与匹配引擎</h2><h3 id=\"规则的数据结构\">规则的数据结构</h3><p>一条规则的完整形态包括触发条件、生效范围、动作、优先级与生效期。把它写成结构化数据而不是脚本，是可解释性与可回滚的前提：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;rule_id&quot;: &quot;DG-SPLIT-AIR-001&quot;,&#10;  &quot;version&quot;: 7,&#10;  &quot;priority&quot;: 100,&#10;  &quot;scope&quot;: { &quot;destination_country&quot;: [&quot;US&quot;, &quot;CA&quot;], &quot;channel_class&quot;: [&quot;AIR&quot;] },&#10;  &quot;when&quot;: [{ &quot;fact&quot;: &quot;line.dangerous_goods_class&quot;, &quot;op&quot;: &quot;in&quot;, &quot;value&quot;: [&quot;BATTERY_LI&quot;, &quot;BATTERY_LI_ION&quot;] }],&#10;  &quot;then&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;action&quot;: &quot;force_split&quot;, &quot;into&quot;: &quot;one_package_per_line_item&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;action&quot;: &quot;pin_channel_class&quot;, &quot;value&quot;: &quot;AIR_RESTRICTED_OR_SEA&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;action&quot;: &quot;tag&quot;, &quot;value&quot;: &quot;DG_HANDLING_REQUIRED&quot; }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;valid_from&quot;: &quot;2026-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;valid_to&quot;: null,&#10;  &quot;explain&quot;: &quot;航空渠道下锂电池商品不得与普货同包，强制独立成包并改派可承运渠道&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rule_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DG-SPLIT-AIR-001\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"priority\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"scope\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"destination_country\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"US\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CA\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"channel_class\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"AIR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"when\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"fact\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"line.dangerous_goods_class\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"op\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"in\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"BATTERY_LI\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"BATTERY_LI_ION\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"then\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"force_split\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"into\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"one_package_per_line_item\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pin_channel_class\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"AIR_RESTRICTED_OR_SEA\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tag\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DG_HANDLING_REQUIRED\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"valid_from\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"valid_to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"explain\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"航空渠道下锂电池商品不得与普货同包，强制独立成包并改派可承运渠道\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个字段值得单独说明。<code>priority</code> 是冲突消解的依据（下一节详述）。<code>valid_from</code> / <code>valid_to</code> 让规则<strong>自带生效期</strong>——这是应对临时性禁运的标准做法，无需人工在到期日手动删除规则，减少了「忘了删」导致的长期错误约束。<code>explain</code> 不是注释，它是<strong>面向买家与客服的文案来源</strong>：当拆单动作影响到买家时，系统需要能说清「为什么这单拆了」，而这句话不该在代码里硬编码。</p>\n<h3 id=\"匹配与冲突消解\">匹配与冲突消解</h3><p>规则匹配的本质是「一组谓词对一组事实做求值」。当事实数量与规则数量都很大时，逐条求值是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(R \\times F)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，会成为下单路径上的热点。工业界的标准解法是 <strong>Rete 算法</strong>：把规则条件编译成一张有向无环图（本质上是广义的 trie），事实作为工作记忆元素从根节点注入，只对<strong>增量</strong>做传播，命中状态缓存在 alpha memory 与 beta memory 中，从而让匹配代价理论上与规则数量无关（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rete_algorithm\">Rete algorithm</a>）。代价是内存占用显著上升，因为要为每条规则保存部分匹配状态。</p>\n<p>对拆单引擎而言，是否上 Rete 取决于规则规模：几十条规则时直接遍历足够快；数百条以上、且下单 QPS 很高时，Rete 的增量匹配才有明显收益。不要因为「Rete 更先进」就提前引入——它带来的调试复杂度（很难回答「为什么这条规则命中了」）是真实成本。</p>\n<p>冲突消解的策略有且只有两种值得采用：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>优先级覆盖</td>\n<td>命中多条时只执行优先级最高的一条</td>\n<td>动作互斥（如「强制拆」vs「强制合」）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全部合并</td>\n<td>命中多条时全部执行，动作取并集</td>\n<td>动作可叠加（如多个 <code>tag</code>、多个 <code>force_split</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>危险的是<strong>混合使用却不声明</strong>。正确做法是给每个动作声明其合并语义：<code>force_split</code> 是单调的（拆了不能再合），可以并集；<code>pin_channel_class</code> 是互斥的（一条渠道只能有一个），必须按优先级。把这条写进动作的元数据，冲突消解就可以自动化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"actions:&#10;  force_split: { merge: union, conflict_free: true }&#10;  tag: { merge: union, conflict_free: true }&#10;  pin_channel_class: { merge: exclusive, conflict_free: false }&#10;  forbid_warehouse: { merge: union, conflict_free: true }&#10;  max_package_count: { merge: min, conflict_free: false }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">actions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  force_split</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">merge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">union</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">conflict_free</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  tag</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">merge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">union</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">conflict_free</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  pin_channel_class</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">merge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">exclusive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">conflict_free</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  forbid_warehouse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">merge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">union</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">conflict_free</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  max_package_count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">merge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">conflict_free</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>max_package_count</code> 的 <code>merge: min</code> 是一个细节但很关键：两条规则分别限制「最多 3 包」和「最多 2 包」，合并结果必须是 2，取最小值而不是后来的覆盖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规则的层次-全局-区域-订单级\">规则的层次：全局、区域、订单级</h2><h3 id=\"三层规则的覆盖顺序\">三层规则的覆盖顺序</h3><p>拆单规则天然分三层，它们的变更频率与影响面差别很大：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>变更频率</th>\n<th>生效范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全局策略</td>\n<td>默认目标权重（成本 vs 时效）</td>\n<td>季度</td>\n<td>全站</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>区域/渠道规则</td>\n<td>某国禁运电池、某渠道临时限重</td>\n<td>周</td>\n<td>目的地 × 渠道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>订单级干预</td>\n<td>客服为 VIP 强制单仓发货</td>\n<td>实时</td>\n<td>单张订单</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>覆盖顺序必须是<strong>订单级 &gt; 区域 &gt; 全局</strong>，且高层的规则不能违反低层的硬约束。这句话的后半句是安全边界：客服的订单级干预可以「选择更贵的拆法」，但不能「让危险品混装」。实现上就是把硬约束（<code>kind: hard</code>，见 <a href=\"weight-dg-customs-split\">重量体积/特货/清关主体拆分</a>）放在覆盖链之外，任何层的规则都无法绕过。</p>\n<h3 id=\"用规则表达-倾向-而非-命令\">用规则表达&quot;倾向&quot;而非&quot;命令&quot;</h3><p>不是所有规则都该是硬命令。跨境场景里大量存在「优先但不强制」的业务意图，例如「东海岸订单优先从新泽西仓发，除非缺货」。把它写成 <code>force_warehouse</code> 会在缺货时产生非法解，正确写法是<strong>偏好权重</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;rule_id&quot;: &quot;PREFER-EWR-FOR-EASTCOAST&quot;,&#10;  &quot;priority&quot;: 40,&#10;  &quot;when&quot;: [{ &quot;fact&quot;: &quot;destination.postal_prefix&quot;, &quot;op&quot;: &quot;in&quot;, &quot;value&quot;: [&quot;10-19&quot;, &quot;20-29&quot;, &quot;30-39&quot;] }],&#10;  &quot;then&quot;: [{ &quot;action&quot;: &quot;adjust_cost&quot;, &quot;target&quot;: &quot;warehouse:US-EWR-02&quot;, &quot;delta&quot;: -2.5, &quot;semantics&quot;: &quot;soft_preference&quot; }],&#10;  &quot;explain&quot;: &quot;东海岸订单从新泽西仓发货可省一次跨区转运，缺货时自动失效&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rule_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PREFER-EWR-FOR-EASTCOAST\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"priority\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">40</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"when\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"fact\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"destination.postal_prefix\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"op\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"in\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"10-19\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"20-29\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"30-39\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"then\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"adjust_cost\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"target\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"warehouse:US-EWR-02\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"delta\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-2.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"semantics\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"soft_preference\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"explain\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"东海岸订单从新泽西仓发货可省一次跨区转运，缺货时自动失效\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>soft_preference</code> 与硬命令的区别在失效行为：缺货时偏好自然失效（因为该仓根本不在候选里），无需任何特殊处理。这比写「if 有货 then 强制」要健壮得多，因为后者需要引擎在运行时重新求值条件，而前者只是往成本里加了一个可加项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规则的可解释性与回滚\">规则的可解释性与回滚</h2><h3 id=\"为什么每次拆单都要留决策记录\">为什么每次拆单都要留决策记录</h3><p>一条被广泛采纳的工程实践是：为每次拆单决策持久化一条<strong>决策记录</strong>，包含输入事实的摘要、命中的规则 ID 与版本、被排除的候选方案及排除原因、最终选择与得分。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;decision_id&quot;: &quot;SD-2026-0912-7731&quot;,&#10;  &quot;order_id&quot;: &quot;SO-2026-0912-7731&quot;,&#10;  &quot;rules_engine_version&quot;: &quot;2026.09.1&quot;,&#10;  &quot;matched_rules&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;rule_id&quot;: &quot;DG-SPLIT-AIR-001&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: 7, &quot;effect&quot;: &quot;force_split&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;rule_id&quot;: &quot;PREFER-EWR-FOR-EASTCOAST&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: 3, &quot;effect&quot;: &quot;cost_delta:-2.5&quot; }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;candidates_evaluated&quot;: 6,&#10;  &quot;rejected&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;plan_id&quot;: &quot;P1&quot;, &quot;reason&quot;: &quot;hard_constraint:dg_compat&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;plan_id&quot;: &quot;P4&quot;, &quot;reason&quot;: &quot;hard_constraint:importer_of_record&quot; }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;selected&quot;: { &quot;plan_id&quot;: &quot;P3&quot;, &quot;score&quot;: 41.8, &quot;packages&quot;: 2 },&#10;  &quot;solver&quot;: { &quot;mode&quot;: &quot;exact&quot;, &quot;elapsed_ms&quot;: 34 }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"decision_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SD-2026-0912-7731\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"order_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SO-2026-0912-7731\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rules_engine_version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026.09.1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"matched_rules\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"rule_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DG-SPLIT-AIR-001\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"effect\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"force_split\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"rule_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PREFER-EWR-FOR-EASTCOAST\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"effect\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cost_delta:-2.5\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"candidates_evaluated\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rejected\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"plan_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"P1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"hard_constraint:dg_compat\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"plan_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"P4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"hard_constraint:importer_of_record\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"selected\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"plan_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"P3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"score\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">41.8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"packages\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"solver\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"mode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"exact\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"elapsed_ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">34</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>rejected</code> 与 <code>reason</code> 是这张记录里最有价值的部分。客诉说「为什么我的订单被拆成三个包裹」，答案通常不是「因为最优解是这样」，而是「因为另外两个更便宜的方案违反了某条硬约束」。能直接把这个原因调出来，客服的沟通成本会下降一个量级；反之，一个只记录最终结果的系统在遇到质疑时只能靠工程师人工重放。</p>\n<h3 id=\"规则变更的灰度与回滚\">规则变更的灰度与回滚</h3><p>规则配置的变更应该走与代码相同的发布纪律：<strong>版本化、灰度、可回滚</strong>。推荐的最小机制是给规则集打整体版本号，新订单按灰度比例分流到新旧两个版本，比较关键指标（拆单率、履约成本、客诉率），异常时回退版本号即可让新订单重新使用旧规则——已产生的订单不被追溯改写。</p>\n<p>这里有一个必须显式处理的边界：<strong>规则回滚不影响已下单的订单</strong>。已经按旧规则拆成的子单不会因为规则变更而重新合并，否则会引发运单作废、预留释放、买家通知等一连串副作用。这个「不追溯」原则与第三章的状态聚合是一致的设计取向。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>规则的三个层次——<strong>条件、动作、优先级</strong>——必须分开设计；优先级不是「数值小的先赢」这种隐式约定，而是由动作的合并语义决定的。</li>\n<li>动作应声明 <code>merge</code> 语义（union / exclusive / min），冲突消解才能自动化；混合使用而不声明是典型的可维护性缺陷。</li>\n<li>规则用 <code>valid_from</code> / <code>valid_to</code> 表达生效期，避免临时禁运规则被遗忘。</li>\n<li>大规模规则匹配可用 <strong>Rete 算法</strong>做增量匹配，代价是内存与调试复杂度；规则少时不要提前引入。</li>\n<li>三层规则的覆盖顺序为<strong>订单级 &gt; 区域 &gt; 全局</strong>，但任何层都不能绕过硬约束。</li>\n<li>业务「倾向」应表达为成本增量（<code>soft_preference</code>）而非硬命令，这样在资源不足时自然失效。</li>\n<li>每次拆单都应持久化决策记录，尤其是<strong>被排除候选及其原因</strong>，这是可解释性与客诉处理的基础。</li>\n<li>规则变更走版本化 + 灰度 + 回滚，且<strong>不追溯</strong>已下单订单。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"拆单规则与优先级配置","id":"拆单规则与优先级配置"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：因子是事实，规则是判断，优先级是秩序","id":"核心概念-因子是事实-规则是判断-优先级是秩序"},{"level":2,"text":"条件表达式与匹配引擎","id":"条件表达式与匹配引擎"},{"level":3,"text":"规则的数据结构","id":"规则的数据结构"},{"level":3,"text":"匹配与冲突消解","id":"匹配与冲突消解"},{"level":2,"text":"规则的层次：全局、区域、订单级","id":"规则的层次-全局-区域-订单级"},{"level":3,"text":"三层规则的覆盖顺序","id":"三层规则的覆盖顺序"},{"level":3,"text":"用规则表达\"倾向\"而非\"命令\"","id":"用规则表达-倾向-而非-命令"},{"level":2,"text":"规则的可解释性与回滚","id":"规则的可解释性与回滚"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么每次拆单都要留决策记录","id":"为什么每次拆单都要留决策记录"},{"level":3,"text":"规则变更的灰度与回滚","id":"规则变更的灰度与回滚"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"重量体积/特货/清关主体拆分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-intelligent-split-fulfillment/split-factor-rule/weight-dg-customs-split"},"next":{"title":"运费/时效/拆单数目标权衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-intelligent-split-fulfillment/split-optimization/cost-transit-split-objective"}}